WEBVTT

00:07:55.057 --> 00:08:01.081
What I notice here is every time,
right from the beginning to the end,

00:08:01.691 --> 00:08:06.612
all multiplication results
are even, without any odds.

00:08:07.552 --> 00:08:09.092
And how is it possible?

00:08:09.952 --> 00:08:14.873
That's possible because the number itself
which is getting multiplied,

00:08:14.873 --> 00:08:16.882
is an even number.

00:08:17.562 --> 00:08:24.282
This tells me if I am even
to myself, as an individual,

00:08:24.282 --> 00:08:26.723
nothing odd will come my way.

00:08:26.723 --> 00:08:28.292
(Laughter)

00:08:28.292 --> 00:08:32.991
Now this of course doesn't mean I don't
come across any odd or bad situations.